            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[AgentsEye 0.17.4 moves automatic updates to the public AgentsEye GitHub release
feed. The application source remains private; only signed, notarized downloads
and release metadata are published.

This build also includes the immediate, animation-free menu-bar panel introduced
in 0.17.3.
]]></description>
