            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[AgentsEye 0.17.3 makes the menu-bar panel appear immediately with no opening
animation. The panel no longer sweeps, pulses, breathes, or glows when opened.

This build is signed with Developer ID, notarized by Apple, stapled, and
accepted by Gatekeeper.
]]></description>
